+`romfs_index.c`/`romfs_index.h` validate an optional PS5 loose-RomFS metadata index (bounds, names, sorted rows and SHA-256 trailer). It avoids title-side enumeration; contents remain loose files. Startup checks three direct reads, not every asset hash.
